Inspection shaft concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou shaft wall brick module equipment introduction:
Zhengzhou Yixin is a professional manufacturer of concrete manhole module brick machines, manhole block machinery and well wall module machinery in China, with semi-automatic to fully automated production lines.
Through years of practice and development, it has now become a company with high quality products, mainly producing hydraulic, mobile, fully automatic inspection wells series equipment and accessories.
Inspection of concrete module production and processing equipment for well wall bricks Zhengzhou well wall brick module equipment assembly site:
Inspection shaft concrete module production and processing equipment Zhengzhou shaft wall brick module equipment features and advantages:
The Xinxi inspection well block brick machine is widely used for new construction materials of municipal underground structures such as coal, heat, water, electricity and gas.
For example, various inspection wells of drainage and storage facilities, rainwater inlets, square ditches, septic tanks and small structures, bridge wing walls, etc.
The advantage of using concrete modules to build inspection wells is that the module has a concave and convex groove structure on all sides, which can be combined to form a chain lock.
The shear strength of the well wall is far superior to that of the horizontal friction masonry.
The module is a hollow structure, and after being assembled, the longitudinal holes are connected and the transverse holes are intersected. After the core of the hole is poured, a cast-in-place concrete network structure is formed, which plays a role in secondary reinforcement and waterproofing.
The module has slots for reinforcing bars in both directions, and the horizontal rebar and vertical reinforcing bar correspondingly improve the overall strength of the structure.
In addition, the inspection wells and drainage wells built with concrete inspection well modules are unlikely to collapse, sink or leak. The mechanical properties of the wall modules are stable, the operation is simple, and the dimensions are standard.
The intelligent control of the concrete inspection well module brick machine is equipped with data input and output devices, one-key touch LCD display monitoring mechanical operation of the whole process, realizing ideal man-machine dialogue, automatic analysis ratio, density operation, safety logic control and fault diagnosis system.
The shaft wall module mechanical hydraulic system adopts single cylinder hydraulic and transmission, double cylinder hydraulic and transmission.
The independent hydraulic integration station avoids the impact of the main machine vibration on the hydraulic system, thereby ensuring the reliability of the hydraulic system.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment hopper moves forward, the demolding mold box rises, the storage bin door closes, and the automatic conveying board is completed independently by hydraulic system to reduce mechanical wear and repair.
The concrete inspection well module brick machine equipment adopts imported computers, electrical appliances, seals and hydraulic parts to ensure the stable and reliable comprehensive performance of the equipment.
The shaft wall module mechanical vibration platform uses integral plate steel, and the table surface is line-cut and molded without welding points, which guides the filler box to swing freely and reduces mechanical wear and tear.
This reduces the load on the mold, combines the packing and double encryption amplitude, and adopts integrated and fully synchronous table vibration and mold vibration to ensure the compaction effect.
The wall module of the well is mechanically excited by machinery, and the amplitude is automatically controlled by computer according to the cost performance of raw materials. There is no wear braking, so that the service life is prolonged and the cost is reduced.
The shaft wall module has dual functions of mechanical automatic control and manual control.
