Let the university spirit resonate with the spirit of the times - Xinhuanet
The so-called university spirit refers to a series of educational concepts and values that have been accumulated over time during the development process of a university, which is the soul of the university.
From ancient times to the present, the university spirit is crucial to the development of politics, economy, culture, science and technology, society, and even the progress of a nation.
Since the birth of the world's first modern university, universities have shouldered a unique mission different from that of other social organizations. For Chinese universities, which emerged in the autumn of national crisis, their spirit is deeply influenced by traditional culture and changes in the times, advocating the value concept of “benefiting the world by being virtuous, and governing the country by being well-rounded” and the patriotism of “strengthening education and strengthening the country”.
At present, the trend of informatization and internationalization in higher education is becoming increasingly obvious, and the global competition in education, science and technology, and talent is intensifying. As an important “supply side”, the structural reform of higher education is facing unprecedented opportunities and challenges.
In particular, the proposal of the “Overall Plan for Promoting the Construction of World-class Universities and Disciplines” has shown the confidence and determination of China to move from a higher education power to a higher education superpower, and has also put forward higher and newer requirements for university development.
How can we strive to rank among the world’s top universities in a relatively short time, accelerate the construction of several world-class universities and a number of world-class disciplines on the basis of still having certain gaps, and achieve “overtaking on a curve”?
In addition to firm confidence in goals, paths and capabilities, universities should also give full play to three advantages: first, latecomer advantage, by continuously introducing outstanding overseas academic talents, learning from the advanced experience of world-class universities, and achieving a significant improvement in academic level and school-running quality; second, cultural advantage, inheriting the wisdom of Chinese civilization accumulated over five thousand years, carrying forward and developing excellent traditional culture, so as to gather strength, shape brands and enhance image; third, institutional advantage, giving play to the institutional superiority of socialist countries, strengthening goal-driven, pooling consensus and joint efforts, optimizing resource allocation, and providing sustainable and solid guarantee for schools to accelerate catching up with the world's advanced level.
It is particularly important to realize that it is impossible for all universities to be alike in building world-class universities. While each university should play its strengths, it must also highlight its personality and characteristics.
The characteristics of the schools should have common Chinese characteristics, and also reflect their own unique goals, educational traditions and resource endowments.
As for Zhejiang University, we attach great importance to three aspects of characteristics in our education and teaching: first, we emphasize the characteristics of innovation and entrepreneurship talent training, build an integrated educational environment of science and technology education and industry and university cooperation, and form a full-chain entrepreneurial education ecosystem; second, we emphasize the characteristics of cross-disciplinary convergence, promote the optimization and adjustment of the discipline system, create a cross-disciplinary institutional environment, actively cultivate cross emerging disciplines and landmark cross results; third, we emphasize the characteristics of the education system and social service, carry out in-depth international exchanges and cooperation, accelerate the formation of a pan-Zhejiang University industrial research and production cooperation system.
In this process, it is particularly important to always adhere to the university spirit and make the university spirit resonate with the spirit of the times.
For Zhejiang University, the school motto of "seeking truth and innovation", the common values of "studying hard, cultivating virtue, making a clear distinction, and being earnest", and "embracing rivers and lakes, enlightening truth and virtue, opening up things for the people, and building our country" together constitute the latest expression system of Zhejiang University spirit.
This is an important guarantee for schools to adhere to the correct direction of education and constantly accumulate cultural height and consolidate spiritual strength. It is rich in connotation and profound in significance.
Among them, “embrace the rivers and seas” emphasizes the spirit of openness and inclusiveness, reflects the idea of “using talents from all over the world”, and is manifested in the quality concept of learning from the world’s famous universities; “seek truth and cultivate virtue” emphasizes the spirit of seeking truth and pursuing goodness, which means that while pursuing the truth, universities should also receive the cultivation of virtue and the tempering of character; “open the door to the world and serve the people” reflects the spirit of reform and innovation, which includes the pursuit of new knowledge and innovation in scientific research, and is also manifested in reform and development, and in breaking away from the old and innovating; “build our country” emphasizes the spirit of patriotism and dedication, which means that universities should always share the glory and shame with the nation.
This series of spiritual concepts and value pursuits is the soul of Zhejiang University's 120-year history.
“Those who are wise can hear in silence; those who are enlightened can see in the invisible.”
China’s universities should further base themselves on the overall situation of socialism with Chinese characteristics, deeply understand the historical mission and position of higher education, and accelerate their development into world-class universities.
At the same time, we should adhere to humanistic care and independence, so that the university spirit and the spirit of the times and national spirit can interact with each other, thus providing an inexhaustible driving force for achieving national prosperity and rejuvenation and realizing the common ideal of mankind.
