Do you have any problems with the initial registration of first-level cost engineer and continuing education hours?
Those who register late should provide a certificate of continuing education. Those who register late should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 30 hours in the past year. Those who re-register should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 120 hours in the past four years. Those who re-register should provide a certificate of continuing education of no less than 30 hours for each full year.
Cost Engineer Continuing Education Fee Standard
The cost engineers who participate in online continuing education must pay the learning fees to each management institution when they register. Generally, the standard is: 300 yuan/person/year for 30 hours of compulsory courses (including the unified continuing education textbook);
The cost of 30-credit elective courses is 300 yuan/person/year.
The cost of 30 hours compulsory courses and 30 hours elective courses is 600 yuan/person/year (including continuing education unified teaching materials).
(1) Participate in the online continuing education of registered cost engineers organized by the China Construction Cost Management Association or provincial and departmental management agencies, and calculate the class hours according to the time recorded in the online learning courseware;
(II) Participate in the centralized classroom training of registered cost engineers and various types of training courses, seminars and other activities organized by the China Cost Engineering Association or provincial and departmental management agencies. 4 class hours can be recognized for every half day;
(3) Participate in continuing education courses of China Price Association, provincial and departmental cost engineers and cost staff, 10 class hours can be recognized for every half day;
(4) Participate in the research of the China Price Association and provincial-level topics, the compilation of industry standards, and the compilation of teaching materials, with 30 hours recognized each year for each item;
(6) Participating in the preparation of textbooks for the national cost engineer professional qualification examination, as well as the setting of questions, review and grading, 30 hours can be recognized every year;
(7) Engineering cost-related professional papers and works published under personal name and publicly released (based on formal publication number).
12 class hours are recognized for every 10,000 words of published works;
For papers published in national-level publications, 8 class hours will be recognized for every 1000 words, 5 class hours will be recognized for every 1000 words for papers published in provincial-level publications, and 3 class hours will be recognized for every 1000 words for papers published in municipal-level publications.
(9) Participate in the public training organized by the project cost consulting enterprise approved or authorized by the China Price Association, provincial and departmental management agencies, and provincial cost association (except for general management and skills training of enterprises), 4 class hours can be recognized every half day, and a maximum of 30 class hours can be recognized every year.
Cost Engineer Network Continuing Education Learning Process
After the registration agency receives the fee, the student identity will be activated immediately. The cost engineer can enter the online education classroom with the user name and password.
The students learned through the on-demand courseware, asking questions, online discussion, etc.
If you forget your password, and you cannot log in to study because the username and password are incorrect, please contact the registration institution to which you belong. The registration institution can help you change your password (but cannot change your username) and then you can log in again using your changed password.
