People's Daily Opinion: A good start for the 14th Five-Year Plan - A discussion on learning and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Working Conference - Xinhuanet
Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, December 11 -- People's Daily, December 12 -- Commentator's article: "14th Five-Year Plan" achieves a good start -- On studying and implementing the spirit of the Central Economic Work Conference
“A good start has been made in the ‘14th Five-Year Plan’”, the Central Economic Working Conference held from December 8 to 10 highly praised the achievements made in China’s economic and social development over the past year.
General Secretary Xi Jinping delivered an important speech at the meeting, profoundly summarized the economic work in 2021, analyzed the current economic situation in depth, and made major arrangements for the economic work in 2022, which pointed out the direction of progress and provided fundamental guidance for us to do a good job in next year's economic work and welcome the successful convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
We solemnly celebrate the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, officially announce the completion of building a moderately prosperous society in all respects and achieving the first centenary goal, and embark on a new journey to comprehensively build a modern socialist country and achieve the second centenary goal.
We convened the 19th CPC Sixth Plenary Session to summarize the major achievements and historical experience of the Party’s 100-year struggle, and adopted the third historical resolution in the history of the Party, the Resolution of the CPC Central Committee on the Major Achievements and Historical Experience of the Party’s 100-year Struggle, which is a political declaration for the Chinese Communists in the new era to remember their original mission and adhere to and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics, and is a guide for action to learn from history, open up the future, and realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
Over the past year, the world has witnessed unprecedented changes and the COVID-19 pandemic has affected the world, and the external environment has become more complex and severe. The domestic prevention and control of COVID-19 and the economic and social development tasks are extremely heavy and difficult.
The Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as its core has adhered to the overall plan of domestic and international affairs, adhered to the general tone of seeking progress while maintaining stability, calmly responded to the century-old changes and the century-long pandemic, coordinated epidemic prevention and control with economic and social development, accelerated the construction of a new development pattern, strengthened macroeconomic policy regulation across the cycle, focused on promoting sustained and healthy economic development, deepened reform and opening-up innovation, and worked hard to complete the arduous tasks of reform and development, achieving new major achievements in all aspects of the Party and the country.
A good start has been made in the 14th Five-Year Plan, which is reflected in the new steps taken to build a new development pattern and the new achievements made in high-quality development.
China’s economic development and epidemic prevention and control have maintained global leadership, with strong resilience, potential, and momentum; national strategic scientific and technological forces have accelerated in size, major innovative achievements have emerged, scientific and technological innovation capabilities have continued to improve, and key core technologies have achieved new breakthroughs; the resilience of industrial chains has been enhanced, foreign trade volume has increased in quality, structure continues to be optimized, and new growth drivers represented by new industries, new business models, and new modes of operation have grown and strengthened; reform and opening up have been pushed forward to greater depths, efforts have been made to unblock bottlenecks that constrain supply-demand matching and factor flow, and high-level opening-up has been used to create new advantages for cooperation and competition; livelihood security has been effective, employment scale has continued to expand, residents’ income growth has kept pace with economic growth, grain production has remained above 1.3 trillion jin for seven consecutive years, and we have achieved “eighteen consecutive bumper harvests”; ecological civilization construction has continued to advance, carbon peak and carbon neutrality work have been coordinated, green and low-carbon transformation has been steady, and ecological environment protection has achieved new results.
These achievements are the result of the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the result of the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and the result of the concerted efforts and hard work of the whole Party and people of all ethnic groups in the country.
Practice has once again proved that the Party's establishment of Comrade Xi Jinping as the core of the Party Central Committee and the whole Party, and the establishment of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era as the guiding ideology, is of decisive significance to the development of the cause of the Party and the country in the new era and to the historical process of promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
With General Secretary Xi Jinping as the core of the Party Central Committee and the whole Party, with the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, and with the unity and tenacious struggle of the whole Party and people of all ethnic groups in the country, we will surely be able to overcome all kinds of difficulties and obstacles, and create new glories of the times and build new historical achievements on the new journey of building a modern socialist country in an all-round way.
The 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China will be held next year, which is a major event in the political life of the party and the country.
We should carry forward the great spirit of building the Party, adhere to the general keynote of seeking progress while maintaining stability, implement the new development concept in a complete, accurate and comprehensive manner, accelerate the construction of a new development pattern, comprehensively deepen reform and opening up, adhere to innovation-driven development, promote high-quality development, adhere to supply-side structural reform as the main line, coordinate epidemic prevention and control with economic and social development, coordinate development and security, continue to do a good job in "six stabilities" and "six guarantees", continuously improve people's livelihoods, focus on stabilizing the macro economy, keep the economy operating within a reasonable range, and maintain social stability. Then we will surely be able to maintain a stable and healthy economic environment, a peaceful and prosperous social environment, and a clean and upright political environment, and welcome the successful convening of the 20th National Congress of the Communist Party of China with excellent achievements.
Let us unite more closely around the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, enhance the "Four Consciousnesses", strengthen the "Four Spheres of Confidence", and achieve the "Two Upholds", continuously improve political judgment, political comprehension, and political execution, implement the decisions and arrangements of the Party Central Committee in actual actions, and continue to push forward the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era.
