President of the BiH Olympic Committee: I firmly believe that China has the ability to host a successful Winter Olympics in this special period - Xinhuanet
Xinhua News Agency, Sarajevo, December 11 -- The president of the Olympic Committee of Bosnia and Herzegovina, Kvesic, said recently that Bosnia and Herzegovina is very much looking forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics and firmly believes that China has the ability to host the Winter Olympics in a special period.
Recently, Ji Ping, the Chinese ambassador to Bosnia and Herzegovina, met with Kvesic, the president of the Olympic Committee of Bosnia and Herzegovina, at the Sarajevo Olympic Center.
During the meeting, Kvesic spoke highly of China-Croatia relations and said that he had visited China on the occasion of the 2008 Beijing Summer Olympics and was deeply impressed by the excellent organization work of China. He firmly believed that China has the ability to host the Winter Olympic Games in a special period; Croatia is very much looking forward to the Beijing Winter Olympics, and the BiH Olympic Committee is actively organizing participation; Croatia hopes to take this as an opportunity to carry out more extensive exchanges and cooperation with China in the field of sports.
Ji Ping said that China and Poland have a special "Olympic bond".
The 1984 Winter Olympics in Sarajevo was successfully held here. Two months from now, the 2022 Winter Olympics in Beijing will also open, presenting a simple, safe, and wonderful event to the world.
We hope that both countries will deepen their cooperation and exchanges in the preparation of winter sports events and athletes' training, and the Chinese Embassy in Bosnia and Herzegovina is willing to continue to play the role of a bridge, promote the continuous deepening of cultural exchanges between the two countries with the Beijing Winter Olympics as an opportunity, and let the people of the two countries "move forward together", and wish the Bosnian athletes to achieve good results in Beijing.
Before the meeting, the BiH Olympic Committee held the "10th Annual Best Athlete" award ceremony, and Ji Ping was invited as a special guest to award the best young athlete in Bosnia and Herzegovina.
The promotion video of the Beijing Winter Olympics was played in a loop at the event.
