For microfluidic chips with ordinary substrates, we suggest that you set the flow rate at 150ul/min or less under conditions of injection pump using pure water as the sample, and the flow rate of the oil phase should be set at 50ul/min or less.
Please increase your flow rate parameter value from slow to fast, taking into account the viscosity of the actual sample liquid.
