Their second trick is that you will be forced to pay the deposit as soon as you go to the store (and once you have paid this money, you can never get it back unless you have enough experience to fight with them in theory).
When I was hesitating to pay the deposit, they would invite their so-called manager to tell you how much discount you can get if you pay the deposit today.
This is a big pitfall, and I am a living example of being deceived. When I was impulsive, I paid more than 10,000 yuan as a deposit.
He gave me a quote with a lot of problems. $70,000 did not include electrical and plumbing, did not include any doors and cabinets, and bathroom, and these three were the biggest part of the cost of the basic equipment.
Apart from these, their service point fees are also higher than other companies.
I lost my trust in this company, and they asked me to sign a contract without explaining anything at the beginning.
When I went to them to get my money back they were very experienced and had a little team of people to deal with you.
They will always bite back and say it's the customer's fault and they're not at fault.
