The “Smart Hunan” 2021 China International Rail Transportation and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit opened - News in Review - Hunan Daily - www.voc.com.cn
Hunan Daily, December 10 (All-media reporter Zhou Zhouheng) On the 9th, the "Intelligent Xiangtan" 2021 China International Rail Transit and Equipment Manufacturing Industry Talent Summit opened in Zhuzhou.
Wang Cheng, member of the Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and Secretary of the Provincial Party Committee Organization Department, attended the opening ceremony and delivered a speech.
Wang Cheng pointed out that holding a talent summit is an important measure to implement the spirit of the Central Talent Work Conference and the 12th Provincial Party Congress, which shows Hunan's sincere desire to value, seek and make good use of talents.
Hunan has a good tradition of recognizing talent, loving talent and respecting talent, as well as a broad platform for helping talent development and environmental conditions for realizing a better life. In recent years, Hunan has implemented the talent leading development strategy in depth, with the Fuzhou Talent Action Plan as a guide, and has built a full chain of talent work pattern to become a fertile soil for the growth and success of talents, a hot land for innovation and entrepreneurship, and a land suitable for living and working.
At present, Hunan is fully implementing the strategic positioning and mission tasks of “three high and four new”, further opening up the door to attract talents, formulating better policies for talent entrepreneurship and innovation, concentrating more resources, creating better conditions, and looking forward to the joint efforts of all sectors of society to gather wisdom and strength for the high-quality development of Hunan.
Changsha, Zhuzhou, Xiangtan exhibition halls and Hunan Free Trade Pilot Zone exhibition hall were set up at the event site. The Provincial Department of Science and Technology, the Provincial Department of Industry and Information Technology, and the Provincial Department of Human Resources and Social Security released the key demand list for scientific and technological innovation in related industries of advanced manufacturing, the talent demand catalog of intelligent manufacturing industry, and the talent demand catalog of young people in intelligent manufacturing industry of post-doctoral mobile stations.
48 large enterprises such as China Railway Rolling Stock Corporation, Zoomlion Heavy Industry Science & Technology Co., Ltd. and Far East Group were on site to recruit talents, and nearly 1000 graduates and social talents participated in the talent project matching.
